## 🔍 Cách phát hiện Fallback Logic

### Pattern cần tìm

```csharp
// ❌ Dấu hiệu fallback
if (condition) { /* fallback */ }
?? default_value
?. null_coalescing
try { } catch { /* continue */ }
|| alternative_value
condition ? value : default
```

### Cách kiểm tra

```bash
# Tìm kiếm fallback patterns
grep -r "??" Assets/_Game/Scripts/  # Null coalescing
grep -r "?." Assets/_Game/Scripts/  # Null conditional
grep -r "||" Assets/_Game/Scripts/  # Logical OR fallback
grep -r "catch" Assets/_Game/Scripts/  # Silent catch
```

